1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wilhelm and Margareta’s second child was Herman Wilhelm (also known as HW), born in Gothenburg in 1835. In 1856 HW left Sweden and set sail for the US, arriving in Pennsylvania and was in Northfield, Minnesota by 1
2 CONC 857. He and his wife, Elizabeth Olson, homesteaded the farm in Kandiyohi County, Minnesota in 1867, and are my great great grandparents. Separate web pages are devoted to HW, Elisabeth, and their descendants.
