2 CONT  	Longitude
2 CONT  	USGS 7.5 map
2 CONT  	Cemetery type Private	Established
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes Information from the Marshall Co. Historical Society: "Farm workers died in an epidemic and were buried along the Middle River on the Melgard farm in the "Tea Garden" south of the house. It was a high bank on the south side 
2 CONC of the river where the tea garden and house were located."
