1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://mankell.org/borgen.html
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/97808751/sven-gunderson-borgen
2 CONT
2 CONT Sven married Margit Syvertsdatter on June 19, 1836, Aal in Hallingdal Valley, Buskerud, Norway. Margit's parents: Syver Svendson Borgen and Bergit Larsdatter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In their marriage record Margit's father is listed as from the Borgen farm. It appears that husband Sven Gunderson then moved to the Borgen farm and took the name Borgen.
