2 CONT Erland O. Melgaard BIRTH	20 Sep 1828 Hundorp, Sør-Fron kommune, Oppland fylke, Norway DEATH	1913 (aged 84–85) BURIAL	 Coon Prairie Cemetery Westby, Vernon County, Wisconsin, USA  MEMORIAL ID	104557121 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Ole Halvorson and Anne Torgersdr. Erland married Oline Marie Norbo and settled in Vernon county, Wisconsin. They had 6 known children, but several died before adulthood.
2 CONT
2 CONT When Erland Olsen Melgaard was born on September 20, 1828, in Sør-Fron, Oppland, Norway, his father, Ola, was 45 and his mother, Anne, was 30. He married Oline Marie Norbo in 1863. They had seven children in 13 years. He died in 1
2 CONC 913 in Wisconsin having lived a long life of 85 years, and was buried in Westby, Wisconsin.
