2 CONT <br/>Marit Eriksdatter remarried in 1845 with Ole Olsen Myre, son of Ole Ostenses Myre and grandson of Osten Olsen Myre, the previous owner. They had six children, Ole Osen Myre who married Ronnau Engebretsdatter Godl(?), Marit Ol
2 CONC sdatter Myre who married Jakob Lundemo, Eli Olsdatter Myre, Hans Olsen Myre who married Oline Strande, Osten Olsen Myre who married Vangen, Mari Olsdatter Myre sho married Hans Andersen Bystad. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sygard means farm south of the main farm.  Today Sygard Romsås  is a bed & breakfast with a number of buildings used as cabins.   Children from second marriage. 1. Ole Olsen Myhre,   b. 21 May 1846, Myre, Øvre, Midt-Strand ,   d. 
2 CONC 1912, Myre, Øvre, Midt-Strand
2 CONT   (Age 65 years)
2 CONT  	2. Mari Olsdtr Myhre,   b. 28 Nov 1848, Myre, Øvre, Midt-Strand 
2 CONT  	3. Hans Olsen Myhre,   b. 9 Aug 1851, Myre, Øvre, Midt-Strand   d. 1911  (Age 59 years)
2 CONT  	4. Østen Olsen Myhre,   b. 16 Sep 1854, Myre, Øvre, Midt-Strand 
2 CONT  	5. Anne Olsdtr Myhre,   b. 14 Aug 1857, Myre, Øvre, Midt-Strand
2 CONT  	6. Eli Olsdtr Myhre,   b. Myre, Øvre, Midt-Strand 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family can be found on Sygard Romsås as far back as 1615.
2 CONT
