2 CONT Letter from Hans L. Melgaar with reference to buying the farm and selling the store.  Uncle mentioned would be Erik.  
2 CONT Ringebo, February 1st 1876
2 CONT Dear Parents and Siblings!
2 CONT I hereby take the liberty of sending you a few words. When I traveled south I met a driver from Skjeggestad, so I got a ride all the way here. I have not yet found out how much they will pay me here for the Year, but I hope to fin
2 CONC d it out shortly.
2 CONT Uncle is now in the process of buying the farm from Johannes Seielstad and Ole Rørvig will acquire Odnes if they can agree on the terms, which I'm confident they will.
2 CONT Hereby you have all … frendliest greetings from
2 CONT Your devoted son,
2 CONT Hans L. Melgaard
