2 CONT [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/census/person/pf01038061003764 Folketelling  1865 Sør Fron]
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/census/person/pf01052091003772 Folketelling 1875 Sør-Fron]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Their families would have known each other as Holen and Melgaard farms are in the same area.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1940 wife Anne was living with her brother Andreas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 1885.  Living in Minneapolis 1930 census.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo of them in later years may have been taken on their 60th wedding anniversary in their apartment at Emerson and Franklin in Minneapolis.  2647 Garfield Ave. apt. 201 MPLS.
2 CONT
2 CONT When Peter Iver Holen was born on February 12, 1859, in Sør-Fron, Oppland, Norway, his father, Iver, was 47 and his mother, Johanne, was 41. He married Anne Larsdatter Melgaard about 1877, in Argyle, Minnesota. They had five child
2 CONC ren in 11 years. He died on October 24, 1938, in Minneapolis, Minnesota, at the age of 79, and was buried in Argyle, Minnesota.
