1 NOTE {geni:about_me} BERNICE IMOGENE MELGARD was born on Sep 22, 1897 in Warren, Marshall Co., Mn.. She died on Jan 15, 1971 in Yoakum, DeWitt, Lavaca Co., Tx.. She married (1) PHILLIP BAKER on Dec 31, 1928. He was born between 1895-19
2 CONC 05. Divorced.  She married (2) GUNNER SCHELDERUP in Jun 1938. He was born between 1895-1905.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1927 she was living in Honolulu at Brookland Hotel.  Working as a stenographer. 1926 stenographer Liberty House the Pierpoint Honolulu. 1923 US Eng. living Fennhurst Honolulu.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents and brother Lloyd George visited her Feb.-March 1929.
2 CONT
