1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/132457553
2 CONT
2 CONT Betsy Osmundson was born in the area of East Norway Lake, Kandiyohi, Minnesota on June 25, 1870. She was the daughter of Osmund and Birgitte “Betsy” Osmundson. On April 2, 1887, probably in Willmar, Minnesota, she married Henry Jo
2 CONC hnson, a recent immigrant from Norway. They had a daughter, Clara, in 1887, and a son, Julius, in 1889.  By 1900, they were living in Willmar and Henry had a retail store. They lived in Willmar until sometime between 1910 and 1920
2 CONC , when they moved to Minneapolis, Minnesota. They moved to Minnetonka, Minnesota before 1930. Henry died in 1936. Betsy then moved in with her sister, Lena Palmer, at 3946 Emerson Ave. N. in Minneapolis. Sometime after 1940, Betsy
2 CONC  moved back to Willmar and died there on April 28, 1958. Betsy is buried at Sunset Memorial Park Cemetery, Block 12, Lot 522, Grave 4, in Minneapolis. bio by: Ken S.
