1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Find A Grave Oline Marie Norbo Melgaard BIRTH	29 Oct 1836 Ringsaker, Ringsaker kommune, Hedmark fylke, Norway DEATH	7 Apr 1930 (aged 93) Westby, Vernon County, Wisconsin, USA BURIAL	 Coon Prairie Cemetery Westby, V
2 CONC ernon County, Wisconsin, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Oline Marie Norbo, daughter of Knud Thorson and Kari Torgersdr had a lot of sadness in her long life. She experienced deaths at young ages of several of her children. Two surviving sons did not marry, and only one daughter, Anna M
2 CONC aria Melgard married and had children. These grandchildren must have brought joy to Oline. Besides the children linked with Oline on Find A Grave, there were two other children, Anna Maria and Karinus (Carl) whose graves and dates
2 CONC  of death have not been found.
2 CONT
