1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Russ Melgaard, beloved father of Kathy and Karla Melgaard and Kelly Baldoni, went home to his heavenly father August 5, 2007. He was preceded in death by his son Scott, brother Gerald of Thief River Falls, MN and p
2 CONC arents Oscar and Gunda Melgaard of Warren, MN. Russ was born in Warren, MN, May 7, 1938. He loved and excelled in sports during high school and played football for the University of Minnesota. Upon graduating, Russ went to work fo
2 CONC r the public accounting firm of Touche Ross and Co. After leaving public accounting, Russ tried many ventures before acquiring Luverne Truck Equipment Co in Luverne, MN with a group of partners. As president of Luverne Truck, and 
2 CONC later Luverne Fire Apparatus, Russ guided these companies to growth and success. He took such pleasure in meeting the challenges of running these companies and loved seeing his employees grow and succeed as well. After retiring, R
2 CONC uss kept busy with golf, travel and overseeing other ventures he had interests in.
2 CONT
2 CONT In addition to his daughters, Russ is survived by son-in-law Edwin Baldoni of Clarks Summit, PA, grandchildren Dario and Gianna Baldoni, sister Barbara (Dave)Lindenberg of Mankato, MN and many nieces and nephews. He also enjoyed a
2 CONC  special relationship with former stepchildren Sheridan and Sara McGaffee of Brandon, SD. He was blessed with so many friends as well and will be greatly missed.
