1 NAME Örjan Thomas Gunnarsson /Ouchterlony/
2 GIVN Örjan Thomas Gunnarsson
2 _MARNM Ouchterlony
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 14 JAN 1914
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stockholm
1 DEAT
2 DATE 25 SEP 2004
1 OCCU Professor of Medicine
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Studentexamen vid Norra Latin i Stockholm 1932. Studier vid Karolinska institutet. Med.lic. 1942. Militärbakteriolog i Finland 1940-42. Med.dr 1949.  Laborator vid Statens Bakteriologiska Laboratorium 1949. Tf prof
2 CONC essor i Göteborg 1951. Professor i bakteriologi vid Göteborgs universitet 1952-80. Tjänstgjorde vid Harvard Medical School and Massachusets General Hospital 1954, WHO Niloufer Hospital, Hyderabad, Indien 1959, Cholera Research Lab
2 CONC oratory, Dacca, Ostpakistan 1968, University of Montana, Missoula 1972, Mwanza Medical Research Centre, Tanzania, 1985, Med. hedersdoktor, Helsingfors universitet 1990. LVS, KVA, NVS.
2 CONT
2 CONT Studentexamination  at the Norra Latin School in Stockholm 1932. Medical studies at the Karolinska Institute, Stockholm.  Military bacteriologist in Finland 1940-42. Med lic 1942. Med dr 1949. Head of department at the Swedish Sta
2 CONC te Bacteriology Laboratory 1949. Acting professor in Gothenburg 1951. Professor of bacteriology at the Medical Faculty of the University of Gothenburg 1952-1980. Lectured at Harvard Medical School and Massachusets General Hospital
2 CONC  1954, WHO Niloufer Hospital, Hyderabad, India 1959, Cholera Research Laboratory, Dacca, East Pakistan 1968, University of Montana, Missoula 1972, Mwanza Medical Research Centre, Tanzania, 1985,  Honorary MD at the University of H
2 CONC elsinki 1990. Member of the Swedish Academy of Science and other scientific bodies and recipient of many honours..
2 CONT
2 CONT Invented the "Ouchterlony plate", a technique for the identification of antigens and antibodies, by measurement of diffusion gradients in gel.
