2 CONT * https://collection.nationalmuseum.se/sv/artists/artist/10676/
2 CONT * https://sok.stadsarkivet.stockholm.se/Bildvisning/Default.aspx?app=fastighetsagare-nikolai-1652-1676-1683#bild1012
2 CONT * https://gw.geneanet.org/slothsama?n=brutscher+vnd+zweig+oberstdorf&oc=&p=melchior
2 CONT * Preutz urmakaränka bild 24 https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/A0060878_00024#?c=&m=&s=&cv=23&xywh=3277%2C2825%2C3085%2C1919 
