1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/132457566/henry-johnson
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Johnson was born in Norway on May 31, 1864. Sometime before 1885, he came to Minnesota. On April 2, 1887, he married Betsy Osmundson, probably in Willmar, Minnesota. They had a daughter, Clara, in 1887, and a son, Julius, in
2 CONC  1889.  In 1900, they were living in Willmar, where Henry owned a grocery store. Henry and Betsy moved to Minneapolis, Minnesota sometime between 1910 and 1920. In 1930, they were living in Minnetonka, Minnesota. Henry had a groce
2 CONC ry store in Glen Lake, Minnesota. Henry died on January 20, 1936 and was buried at Sunset Memorial Park Cemetery, Block 12, Lot 522, Grave 3, in Minneapolis on January 25, 1936. bio by: Ken S.
