1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/132455606/julius-t_-johnson
2 CONT
2 CONT Julius was born on July 10, 1889 in Willmar, Kandiyohi, Minnesota. His parents were Henry Johnson and his wife, Betsy Osmundson, Betsy was born in Willmar, Henry in Norway.  Julius married Yerda Hansen in Hennepin County on August
2 CONC  2, 1912. In 1914, when their son Luverne was born, they lived at 2113-4th Street South in Minneapolis.  Henry was a salesman, and worked for a tea and coffee company. When he was 25, he contracted tuberculosis, and he suffered fr
2 CONC om that the rest of his life. In 1934, he was admitted to the Glen Lake Sanatorium, where he died on January 8, 1936. Julius was buried at Sunset Memorial Park Cemetery, Block 12, Lot 522, Grave 1, in Minneapolis on January 11, 19
2 CONC 36. bio by: Ken S.
