1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of Kalmar,
1 CONT Jonkoping, and Kronoberg. Trathult is not a recognizsed parish name.
1 CONT 3- May 1999: The Swedish Postal Address book has the placenames of:
1 CONT Träthult (by), Fagerhult parish, Kalmar county.
1 CONT Trälhult (gd), Hjorted parish, Kalmar county.
1 CONT I will leave the parish out of the place field for now.
